    /// **Behavior:**
    /// - `supplySource` is **required** — specifies the supply source context (APPSTORE or MAPS)
    /// - Hard-blocked geos (NO_MUID, NOT_SUPPORTED, SOURCE_REMOVED, COUNTRY_NOT_SUPPORTED,
    ///   COUNTRY_NOT_SEARCHABLE) are always excluded from results
    /// - Soft-blocked geos (LOCALITY_LOW_SEARCH_VOLUME, POSTAL_CODE_SPARSE) pass through
    ///   with eligibility data by default — the UI decides how to present them
    /// - With `eligible=true`: soft-blocked geos are also excluded
    ///
    /// **Supply source scoping:**
    /// - `supplySource=MAPS`: Countries excluded, results restricted to US/CA
    /// - `supplySource=APPSTORE`: PostalCode excluded
    ///
    /// **Query constraints:**
    /// - Minimum query length: 2 characters (queries shorter than 2 chars are rejected with `MIN_QUERY_LENGTH`)
    /// - Wildcard `*` is accepted and returns all geos
    /// - If `countrycode` is omitted and `entity` is not `Country`, defaults to `US`
    ///
    ///
    /// - Remark: HTTP `GET /search/geo`.
