    /// Query target CPA suggestion
    ///
    /// Retrieve the suggested Target CPA bid for a new Max Conversions campaign on the App Store. The suggestion is the maximum tap-install CPI across the requested countries or regions that have at least 10 installs in the last 28 days.
    ///
    ///
    ///         **Required Filters:**
    ///
    ///         - `promotedObjectId` (single numeric app ID, `EQUALS`)
    ///
    ///         - `promotedObjectType` (`EQUALS` `APPSTORE_APP`)
    ///
    ///
    ///         **Optional Filters:**
    ///
    ///         - `countryOrRegion` (one or more ISO country/region codes). When omitted, all countries or regions with eligible install volume are considered.
    ///
