    /// Query category suggestions
    ///
    /// Query category suggestions. Supports two query routes based on `queryType`:
    ///
    ///         **Route 1: SUGGESTION** (discover categories for an app)
    ///
    ///         - `queryType` = `SUGGESTION` (REQUIRED)
    ///
    ///         - `promotedObjectId` (REQUIRED)
    ///
    ///         - `promotedObjectType` (REQUIRED)
    ///
    ///         Returns suggested categories based on the promoted object.
    ///
    ///         **Route 2: SEARCH** (look up or search categories)
    ///
    ///         - `queryType` = `SEARCH` (REQUIRED)
    ///
    ///         - `category` (REQUIRED) with operator:
    ///
    ///           - `IN`: fetches popularity for each provided category
