    /// Query app search term popularity data
    ///
    /// Retrieve search term popularity data showing top search terms by search volume within a Country or Region and Genre. Supports WEEKLY and MONTHLY granularity.
    /// **Timezone** is fixed to UTC.
    /// Maximum **pageSize** is 5000. Maximum **2 sort fields**.
    /// Mandatory dimension fields (always returned): countryOrRegion, genre, searchTerm, plus the date field for the selected granularity (week or month).
    /// Optional dimension fields: rankInGenre, searchPopularityInGenre, searchPopularity1to100, searchPopularity1to5.
